        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiinem Musa eng’ kebebertab lagokab Israel, agenge eng’ konom, eng’ bik, ak eng’ akwotisiek, ak kogochi Lawik, che kiribei boisietab gotab Jehovah; ko u ye king’at Jehovah Musa.",
