          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kirikyi Musa kandoik che bo elfusiekab luget, ak kiptainikab elfusiek, ak kiptainikab bogolusiek: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kilenji Musa, Kagiit achek otwogiguk murenikab luget che kibou, ak ma bet agot agenge eng’ achek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kageibu kagochinetab Jehovah kit ne konyor chi age tugul, eng’ tugukab tahabu, ak mugurek che bo kelyek, ak karik che bo eunek, ak peteinik che bo ng’okset, ak munaok, ak sonoek, si koyachi kagaigaet sobonwekyok eng’ taitab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitaach Musa ak Eleasar tisiindet tahabu che bo tukchoto eng’ ichek, agot tuguk tugul che kigitany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak tahabu tugul che bo kagochinet ne kinamjin barak che kiigochi Jehovah, che bo kiptainikab elfusiek, ak che bo kiptainik che bo bogolusiek, ko ki sekelisiek elfusiek taman ak lo ak bogol tisab ak konom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Amu kiga koib murenikab luget tuguk che kigiluul, kiipchigei chi tugul chechik.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitaach Musa ak Eleasar tisiindet tahabu eng’ kiptainikab elfusiek ak che bo bogolusiek, ak koib kobwa emait ne kituiyechin, kobunji kabwatet ne bo lagokab Israel eng’ taitab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
